    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trip</strong> is a hauntingly atmospheric narrative adventure set between two contrasting worlds: the decaying Dustsprawl and the gleaming metropolis of Avidas. Step into the shoes of Aden, a skilled mechanic haunted by loss, as you navigate a fractured society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments\u2014from the makeshift homes of scrappers and rebels to the pristine, oppressive towers of Avidas. Encounter a diverse cast of characters, each carrying their own burdens and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysteries of a world on the brink, where technology and tradition clash, and where every choice shapes your journey. Will you find hope amid the ruins, or succumb to the shadows of a controlled future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply immersive story blending personal struggles with a larger rebellion against oppression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex characters with layered backstories revealed through interactive dialogue and cinematic cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments that reflect the emotional states of characters and the world around them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich soundtrack that enhances the emotional depth and psychedelic undertones of the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a unique dialogue system that influences relationships and unlocks hidden story paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a journey that challenges your perceptions and tests your resolve. The Trip is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s an emotional odyssey through loss, hope, and the fight for freedom.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trip</strong> is a hauntingly atmospheric narrative adventure set between two contrasting worlds: the decaying Dustsprawl and the gleaming metropolis of Avidas. Step into the shoes of Aden, a skilled mechanic haunted by loss, as you navigate a fractured society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments\u2014from the makeshift homes of scrappers and rebels to the pristine, oppressive towers of Avidas. Encounter a diverse cast of characters, each carrying their own burdens and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysteries of a world on the brink, where technology and tradition clash, and where every choice shapes your journey. Will you find hope amid the ruins, or succumb to the shadows of a controlled future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply immersive story blending personal struggles with a larger rebellion against oppression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex characters with layered backstories revealed through interactive dialogue and cinematic cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments that reflect the emotional states of characters and the world around them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich soundtrack that enhances the emotional depth and psychedelic undertones of the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a unique dialogue system that influences relationships and unlocks hidden story paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a journey that challenges your perceptions and tests your resolve. The Trip is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s an emotional odyssey through loss, hope, and the fight for freedom.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Trip: A haunting narrative adventure in a fractured society across two worlds: decaying Dustsprawl &amp; gleaming Avidas. As Aden, a haunted mechanic, explore rich environments, meet diverse characters, and unravel mysteries where choices shape an emotional odyssey of loss, hope &amp; freedom.",
